@startuml UC-A2-sign-out-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
title UC-A2 Sign out (analysis: system sequence)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the person, Playground as one box, and Keycloak as an outside system.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie. Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-A2.
' Not drawn: saying on screen that Keycloak could not be reached (open in UC-A2), and a copy of an earlier
' access token still passing until it expires (open in UC-A2).

actor "Person" as P
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB
participant "Keycloak\n(outside)" as K #ECECEC

P -> PG : 1 ask to sign out
alt a link or image on another site
  PG --> P : nothing happens
else the person asked to sign out
  PG -> PG : 2 end my sign in\nwith Playground
  alt Keycloak cannot be reached
    PG --> P : 5 signed out,\nhome page
  else
    PG --> P : 3 go to Keycloak\nto end your sign in
    P -> K : 3 end my sign in
    K -> K : 4 end my sign in
    K --> P : 4 back to home page
    P -> PG : 5 home page
    PG --> P : 5 you are signed out
  end
end
P -> PG : 6 ask for something
PG --> P : 6 sign in again
@enduml
